        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "吞吐井史与热量参数",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点整理20—30口井、每井至少连续3个周期的记录，包含注汽量、焖井时间、周期产油及周期起止，并补充热损失估计所需的温度与注汽条件。连续周期记录用于校准余热和产量衰减关系，避免拆散前后周期。本例使用显式热状态函数，在每周期300—1200吨、100吨步长的范围内演示计划搜索。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">周期注采数据</span><span class=\"cl-s\">注汽量、干度、焖井、产液</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">单井 10—30 周期</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">油藏与流体</span><span class=\"cl-s\">黏度、厚度、含油饱和度</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">作为条件</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">温度监测</span><span class=\"cl-s\">井温、测温点</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">辅助判断</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">每井连续3周期注汽、焖井、产油与热损失资料</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/enhanced-oil-recovery\">DOE：Enhanced oil recovery<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "热状态估计与周期差异",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">周期间余热、热损失与产量衰减需联合标定</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>主要障碍是井筒热损失、蒸汽条件和地层余热难以直接用单个参数概括，进入后续周期还会出现产量衰减。筹备时应按井组整理连续周期资料，统一注汽与产油计量口径，检查不同焖井时间下的响应差异。热量模拟参数需要结合这些记录标定，重点观察余热假设变化后，推荐分配及累计产油排序是否稳定。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">时序预测<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">序列优化<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">跨井迁移<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
